{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b6f0a8b4-3e6a-4c9a-9a1a-tabbybnpl0001",
    "name": "Noon Payments - Tabby (BNPL Direct)",
    "description": "Covers the Direct Tabby BNPL flow for Noon Payments as documented at https://docs.noonpayments.com/billing/bnpl/direct-tabby\n\nFlow:\n1. CHECK_BNPL_OPTIONS - verify Tabby is an eligible payment option for the order.\n2. INITIATE - create the order with `paymentData.type: TABBY`, get back the Tabby session URL in `result.result.actionHint` (redirect the customer here).\n3. Customer completes the Tabby flow (splits into installments, pays) on Tabby's hosted page - this happens in a browser, it is NOT an API call.\n4. Tabby redirects back to your `configuration.returnUrl` (or fires a webhook).\n5. GET ORDER (or GET ORDER BY REFERENCE) - fetch the final order status.\n\nCANCEL and REFUND requests are included as common follow-up operations once an order exists.\n\nAuthentication: Key-based scheme. Authorization header = `Key ` + Base64(BusinessIdentifier.ApplicationIdentifier:ApplicationKey). The `businessIdentifier`, `applicationIdentifier` and `applicationKey` collection variables are pre-filled with the paysecure_technology sandbox credentials - a collection pre-request script builds the header for every request automatically.\n\nSandbox business `paysecure_technology` - Tabby notes:\n- Tabby is only enabled for AED (SAR is rejected with \"invalid combination of payment details\")\n- The `customer` object only accepts: `registeredSince`, `loyaltyLevel` (int), `orderHistory[]` (amount, purchaseTime, status in [new, processing, complete, refunded, canceled, unknown])\n- `paymentData.data.authenticatorData` is required (empty string accepted)\n- `paymentOption` field is NOT accepted anywhere in this API version\n\nEnvironments (set `baseUrl` accordingly):\n- Global Test: https://api-test.noonpayments.com\n- Global Live: https://api.noonpayments.com\n- KSA Test: https://api-test.sa.noonpayments.com\n- KSA Live: https://api.sa.noonpayments.com\n- Egypt Test: https://api-test.eg.noonpayments.com\n- Egypt Live: https://api.eg.noonpayments.com",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Builds the Key-based Authorization header for every request in this collection.",
          "// See https://docs.noonpayments.com/test/authorization",
          "const override = pm.collectionVariables.get('authorizationHeaderOverride');",
          "",
          "if (override && override.trim().length > 0) {",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authHeader', override.trim());",
          "} else {",
          "    const businessId = pm.collectionVariables.get('businessIdentifier') || '';",
          "    const appId = pm.collectionVariables.get('applicationIdentifier') || '';",
          "    const appKey = pm.collectionVariables.get('applicationKey') || '';",
          "    const raw = businessId + '.' + appId + ':' + appKey;",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authHeader', 'Key ' + btoa(raw));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://api-test.noonpayments.com" },
    { "key": "businessIdentifier", "value": "paysecure_technology" },
    { "key": "applicationIdentifier", "value": "Paysecure_Test" },
    { "key": "applicationKey", "value": "cc777b32538941f0903a5d3453dea9e7", "type": "secret" },
    { "key": "authorizationHeaderOverride", "value": "" },
    { "key": "authHeader", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderReference", "value": "NPORDTEST0001" },
    { "key": "tabbyRedirectUrl", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Check BNPL Options (Tabby)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{authHeader}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"apiOperation\": \"CHECK_BNPL_OPTIONS\",\n    \"order\": {\n        \"amount\": 100,\n        \"currency\": \"AED\",\n        \"category\": \"pay\",\n        \"channel\": \"web\",\n        \"reference\": \"{{orderReference}}\",\n        \"items\": [\n            {\n                \"code\": \"default\",\n                \"name\": \"Test Product\",\n                \"quantity\": 1,\n                \"unitPrice\": 100,\n                \"nvp\": {\n                    \"productSku\": \"SKU001\",\n                    \"risk\": \"low\"\n                }\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    \"customer\": {}\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/v1/order",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["payment", "v1", "order"]
        },
        "description": "Step 1 of the BNPL flow. Checks whether Tabby is an eligible BNPL option for this merchant and order. A successful response lists `result.paymentOptions[]` - look for `method: \"Tabby_Sandbox\"` (sandbox) or `method: \"Tabby\"` (live).\n\nIf `paymentOptions` is empty or Tabby is absent, INITIATE will not work - the order amount/currency is outside Tabby's limits for this MID."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('resultCode is 0 (success)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.resultCode).to.eql(0);",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (jsonData && jsonData.result && jsonData.result.paymentOptions) {",
              "    const options = jsonData.result.paymentOptions;",
              "    const tabby = options.find(o => String(o.type).toUpperCase() === 'TABBY');",
              "    pm.test('Tabby is an eligible BNPL option', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(tabby, 'No Tabby option returned - check order amount/currency vs Tabby limits').to.exist;",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Positive Scenario",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{authHeader}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"apiOperation\": \"CHECK_BNPL_OPTIONS\",\n    \"order\": {\n        \"amount\": 100,\n        \"currency\": \"AED\",\n        \"category\": \"pay\",\n        \"channel\": \"web\",\n        \"reference\": \"NPORDTEST0001\"\n    },\n    \"customer\": {}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/v1/order",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payment", "v1", "order"]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n    \"resultCode\": 0,\n    \"message\": \"Processed successfully\",\n    \"resultClass\": 0,\n    \"classDescription\": \"\",\n    \"actionHint\": \"\",\n    \"requestReference\": \"95120554-94df-45cc-a034-c2aee3e8e7fa\",\n    \"result\": {\n        \"paymentOptions\": [\n            {\n                \"method\": \"Tabby_Sandbox\",\n                \"type\": \"Tabby\",\n                \"action\": \"Tabby\"\n            }\n        ]\n    }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Initiate Order (Tabby)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{authHeader}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n    \"apiOperation\": \"INITIATE\",\n    \"order\": {\n        \"amount\": 100,\n        \"currency\": \"AED\",\n        \"category\": \"pay\",\n        \"channel\": \"web\",\n        \"reference\": \"{{orderReference}}\",\n        \"name\": \"Test Order\",\n        \"items\": [\n            {\n                \"code\": \"default\",\n                \"name\": \"Test Product\",\n                \"quantity\": 1,\n                \"unitPrice\": 100,\n                \"nvp\": {\n                    \"productSku\": \"SKU001\",\n                    \"risk\": \"low\"\n                }\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    \"customer\": {\n        \"registeredSince\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n        \"loyaltyLevel\": 5,\n        \"orderHistory\": [\n            {\n                \"amount\": 100,\n                \"purchaseTime\": \"2024-06-15T12:00:00Z\",\n                \"status\": \"complete\"\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    \"billing\": {\n        \"contact\": {\n            \"firstName\": \"John\",\n            \"lastName\": \"Doe\",\n            \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n            \"phone\": \"+971501234567\"\n        },\n        \"address\": {\n            \"line1\": \"123 Main St\",\n            \"city\": \"Dubai\",\n            \"country\": \"AE\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"shipping\": {\n        \"contact\": {\n            \"firstName\": \"John\",\n            \"lastName\": \"Doe\",\n            \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n            \"phone\": \"+971501234567\"\n        },\n        \"address\": {\n            \"line1\": \"123 Main St\",\n            \"city\": \"Dubai\",\n            \"country\": \"AE\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"paymentData\": {\n        \"type\": \"TABBY\",\n        \"data\": {\n            \"authenticatorData\": \"\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"configuration\": {\n        \"returnUrl\": \"https://www.merchantwebsite.com/response\",\n        \"locale\": \"en\",\n        \"paymentAction\": \"Sale\"\n    }\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/v1/order",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["payment", "v1", "order"]
        },
        "description": "Step 2 of the BNPL flow. Initiates the Tabby session. On success, `result.result.actionHint` contains the Tabby hosted payment URL - redirect the customer there.\n\nNotes:\n- Currency must be AED (Tabby is not enabled for SAR on this MID).\n- `paymentData.data.authenticatorData` is mandatory (empty string is accepted).\n- `customer.email` inside `customer` is rejected - use `billing.contact.email` instead.\n- `paymentOption` must NOT be sent anywhere in this API version."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('resultCode is 0 (success)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.resultCode).to.eql(0);",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (jsonData && jsonData.result) {",
              "    if (jsonData.result.order && jsonData.result.order.id) {",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', jsonData.result.order.id);",
              "    }",
              "    if (jsonData.result.order && jsonData.result.order.reference) {",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set('orderReference', jsonData.result.order.reference);",
              "    }",
              "    if (jsonData.result.result && jsonData.result.result.actionHint) {",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set('tabbyRedirectUrl', jsonData.result.result.actionHint);",
              "        console.log('Redirect customer to Tabby: ' + jsonData.result.result.actionHint);",
              "    }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Positive Scenario",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{authHeader}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"apiOperation\": \"INITIATE\",\n    \"order\": {\n        \"amount\": 100,\n        \"currency\": \"AED\",\n        \"category\": \"pay\",\n        \"channel\": \"web\",\n        \"reference\": \"NPORDTEST0001\"\n    },\n    \"paymentData\": {\n        \"type\": \"TABBY\",\n        \"data\": {\n            \"authenticatorData\": \"\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"configuration\": {\n        \"returnUrl\": \"https://www.merchantwebsite.com/response\",\n        \"paymentAction\": \"Sale\"\n    }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/v1/order",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payment", "v1", "order"]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n    \"resultCode\": 0,\n    \"message\": \"Processed successfully\",\n    \"resultClass\": 0,\n    \"classDescription\": \"\",\n    \"actionHint\": \"\",\n    \"requestReference\": \"3ba2e0a8-4d08-4500-aba5-0f36f8b7ba7c\",\n    \"result\": {\n        \"nextActions\": \"REDIRECT\",\n        \"order\": {\n            \"type\": \"CIT\",\n            \"status\": \"INITIATED\",\n            \"creationTime\": \"2026-07-30T07:01:52.3066207Z\",\n            \"errorCode\": 0,\n            \"id\": 458836634511,\n            \"amount\": 100,\n            \"currency\": \"AED\",\n            \"name\": \"Test Order\",\n            \"reference\": \"NPORDTEST0001\",\n            \"category\": \"pay\",\n            \"channel\": \"web\"\n        },\n        \"configuration\": {\n            \"returnUrl\": \"https://www.merchantwebsite.com/response\",\n            \"paymentAction\": \"Sale\"\n        },\n        \"business\": {\n            \"id\": \"paysecure_technology\",\n            \"name\": \"Paysecure Technology Limited\"\n        },\n        \"result\": {\n            \"actionHint\": \"https://checkout.tabby.ai/payments/pl/2e2f...\",\n            \"status\": \"PENDING\"\n        },\n        \"deviceFingerPrint\": {\n            \"sessionId\": \"458836634511\"\n        }\n    }\n}"
        },
